  "section": "2.7",
  "rulesText": "Determining your character's origin involves choosing a background, a species, and two languages.\n\nA character's background represents the place and occupation that were most formative for the character. The combination of background, species, and languages provides fertile soil for your imagination as you ponder your character's earliest days."
}
